h bill this is rests on the name you confirmed.","Your electricity use is not in the bank data. We estimate about 4573 kWh a year from your bill, assuming you now pay today's typical fixed price (9.35 c/kWh). Tell Sisu your real yearly kWh, printed on your bill, for an exact figure.","If your bill also covers grid (distribution) fees, the real saving is smaller: those fees do not change when you switch seller.","Spot-price contracts are listed but not ranked, because their price changes every hour."],"errors":[]}}

